18. Pending bills JSON

Use this if your SQL editor accepts the VALUE syntax shown in the question.

SELECT JSON_OBJECT(
    'Pending Payment' VALUE JSON_ARRAYAGG(
        -- Create JSON object for every patient
        JSON_OBJECT(
            'Patient' VALUE p.first_name || ' ' || p.last_name,
            'Amount Due' VALUE b.total_amount_due,
            'Amount Paid' VALUE b.amount_paid
        )
    )
) AS pending_payments
FROM patients p
     JOIN billing b
     ON p.patient_id = b.patient_id
WHERE b.amount_paid < b.total_amount_due;

If your table uses total_amount instead of total_amount_due, change this line:

'Amount Due' VALUE b.total_amount_due,

to:

'Amount Due' VALUE b.total_amount,